@startuml
' claim: one CI family; every repository is a ten-line caller parameterised by kind
package "cicd (tag v<major>.<minor>.<patch>, callers pin @v<major>)" {
  [c-quality.yml] as Q
  [c-release.yml] as R
  [lint.yml] as L
}
package "a repository (.github/workflows)" {
  [quality.yml] as q
  [release.yml] as r
  [security.yml] as s
}
q --> Q : uses, with kind: lib|app
r --> q : needs (quality gate)
r --> R : uses, with kind, title
Q ..> [kyr-build deb] : bootstrap by version + sha256 from deps.txt
Q ..> [utils/check_abi.sh] : job abi-gate when abi/layout.txt exists (full history, tags)
R ..> [utils/check_abi.sh] : before packaging and after (exports): a failure publishes nothing
R ..> [kyr-build deb] : bootstrap by version + sha256 from deps.txt
L ..> "cicd itself" : zizmor + actionlint (D5 open: not wired into callers)
@enduml
